WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:05.300
<b>The online path works as follows.</b>

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.700
<b>The customer has already registered independently on our website,</b>

3
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:14.600
<b>filled out the questionnaire, and then paid online, with or without a discount,</b>

4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:20.533
<b>and received the six-digit booking code by e-mail or SMS, which they then bring to you at the pharmacy.</b>

5
00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:27.467
<b>Ideally, the customer arrives with an appointment and the booking code received by SMS or e-mail,</b>

6
00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:32.133
<b>at your pharmacy. And you can start the measurements right away.</b>
